<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>netstandard2.0</TargetFramework>
    <LangVersion>8.0</LangVersion>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <WarningsAsErrors>$(WarningsAsErrors);CS1591</WarningsAsErrors>
    <Copyright>tnakamura</Copyright>
    <Authors>tnakamura</Authors>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <Version>0.2.0</Version>
    <Description>Simple ORM for .NET</Description>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>true</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageTags>sql;orm;database</PackageTags>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/tnakamura/Kuery</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/tnakamura/Kuery</RepositoryUrl>
    <IncludeSymbols>True</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>## v0.2.0

- Rebuilt the LINQ-to-SQL pipeline with typed SQL translation, direct result materialization, and compiled query caching.
- Added MySQL support alongside SQLite, PostgreSQL, and SQL Server.
- Expanded LINQ support for outer joins, set operations, grouping, subqueries, and query-only table-per-hierarchy inheritance.
- Added `FromSql&lt;T&gt;()` for composing LINQ over parameterized SQL, `ToQueryString()` and `TagWith()` for inspecting and annotating queries, and `AsAsyncEnumerable()` for async streaming.
- Added `ExecuteUpdate` and `ExecuteDelete`, along with async equivalents, for set-based changes. Added support for DataAnnotations mapping attributes.
- **Breaking changes.** `KueryQueryProvider` and `KueryQueryable&lt;T&gt;` are now internal. Use `IQueryProvider` and `IQueryable&lt;T&gt;` in consuming code. `BaseTableQuery` was removed. Use `TableQuery&lt;T&gt;` or `IEnumerable&lt;T&gt;` as appropriate.
</PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Bcl.AsyncInterfaces" Version="10.0.0" />
    <None Include="..\..\README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
